        <div class="faq-a"><p>No — no such thing exists for a specific drive, and any guide claiming otherwise is overselling. This is a compilation of recurring patterns from candidate-reported experiences and public placement-prep sources, meant to help you prepare and explain concepts clearly, not memorize a script.</p></div>
