      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q">What's the actual difference between the two guides?<span class="plus">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>The ₹199 Service Edition covers the 14 mass-recruiter IT services companies most students interview with first. The ₹399 Complete Bank covers all 23 — adding product-based and dream companies like Amazon, Oracle, Zoho, Deloitte, and EPAM — plus a coding-solutions appendix and 9 concept reference sheets the Service Edition doesn't include.</p></div>
